      "writtenOn": "2024-10-28T21:12:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this has been the case for a while. I was looking at `U`, and observed that\n- `newApexFile` for dep modules (including native libs) returns the [required](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/udc/+/udc-dev:build/soong/apex/apex.go;l\u003d582?q\u003drepo:googleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fudc%20branch:udc-dev%20func.*newApexFile) of the dep modules\n- Each [required](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/udc/+/udc-dev:build/soong/apex/androidmk.go;l\u003d305) of `a.filesInfo` is added to the required of the top-level apex",
      "parentUuid": "08c47b65_0c292d14",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 24,
        "startChar": 55,
        "endLine": 26,
        "endChar": 6
      },
      "revId": "bd0af89c872b2ba119be1508608f8f96e9c18878",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
