      "writtenOn": "2024-10-25T00:48:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we hit this issue in the Soong-built system image. Not sure how we worked around that. cc: Justin.\n\ncc: Jooyung as this is about vendor APEX.",
      "revId": "bd0af89c872b2ba119be1508608f8f96e9c18878",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
